        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Picture 'Susannah and the Elders' of embroidered silk satin with coloured silks and metal purl, England, ca. 1660"@en , "Picture of embroidered silk satin with coloured silks and metal purl in long and short, split and back stitches, detached darning, French knots, and couched work. With silk-covered parchment and additional details in watercolour. Susannah and the Elders are depicted in the padded oval panel in the centre and is bordered with foliage and animal motifs."@en ;
